        {
          "text": "Police Station Shimlapuri, District Ludhiana",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 735,
          "end": 779
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "The first petition filed by the petitioner Kulpreet Singh vs State Of Punjab on 21 April, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/51820832/\n1 bearing CRM-M-5062-2019 had been dismissed vide a detailed order dated 6.7.2021 2.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 781,
      "end": 1014,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Kulpreet Singh vs State Of Punjab",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 824,
          "end": 857
        },
        {
          "text": "21 April, 2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 861,
          "end": 875
        },
        {
          "text": "6.7.2021",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1003,
          "end": 1011
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "Hon'ble Apex Court in a judgment G.R. Ananda Babu Versus The State of Tamil Nadu & Anr.\narising out of SLP(Crl.) No.213 of 2021 has observed as under:\n1 of 2 Neutral Citation No:=2023:PHHC:056436 2023:PHHC:056436 CRM-M-19687-2023(O&M) -2- \"As a matter of fact, successive anticipatory bail applications ought not to be entertained and more so, when the case diary and the status report, clearly indicated that the accused (respondent No.2) is absconding and not cooperating with the investigation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1015,
      "end": 1512,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Apex Court",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 1023,
          "end": 1033
        },
        {
          "text": "G.R. Ananda Babu Versus The State of Tamil Nadu & Anr",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1048,
          "end": 1101
        },
        {
          "text": "SLP(Crl.) No.213 of 2021",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1118,
          "end": 1142
        },
        {
          "text": "PHHC:056436 2023",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1199,
          "end": 1215
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "The specious reason of change in circumstances cannot be invoked for successive anticipatory bail applications, once it is rejected by a speaking order and that too by the same Judge.\"\n3. Therefore, the present petition is not maintainable and stands dismissed accordingly.\n4.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1513,
      "end": 1789,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "However, it is observed that it is a matter of great concern that the petitioner, who is accused in an FIR for serious offences registered against him way back on 28.12.2018 with a petition for pre- arrest bail filed by him having been dismissed up to the level of High Court on 6.7.2021, he is still roaming about freely and has not been arrested by the local police so far, which reflects badly upon the working of the local police.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1790,
      "end": 2224,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "28.12.2018",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1953,
          "end": 1963
        },
        {
          "text": "6.7.2021",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2069,
          "end": 2077
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "A copy of this order be sent to Commissioner of Police/SSP, Ludhiana for his information and necessary action.",
